  "description": "Voodoo Limba E-Bike: Power, Performance, and Adventure\n\nThe Limba E-Bike combines cutting-edge technology with trail-ready design to take your rides to the next level. Powered by a Bafang rear hub motor delivering 250W of power and 45Nm of torque, it gives you the boost you need to conquer climbs or extend your adventures with ease.\n\nWith five customizable assistance modes, you can fine-tune the power to match your riding style and terrain, all controlled through an intuitive LCD display on the handlebars.\n\nBuilt for adventure, the Limba E-Bike features modern trail geometry with a 70.5° head angle on size S and M, and *71° on size L and XL, delivering a balanced ride across various terrains. The Prowheel 42T, 170mm crankset and microSHIFT CS-H093 11–42T cassette ensure smooth and efficient shifting for both climbs and descents.\n\nEquipped with Tektro MD-C400 mechanical brakes, the Limba delivers reliable stopping power and control. WTB Riddler tires provide confident grip and performance across all weather conditions—perfect for your next off-road adventure.\n\nThe Limba E-Bike is a special kind of bike called an electric gravel bike, which means it's built for both smooth roads and bumpy trails. It has a motor that gives you a boost when you pedal, so hills are easier and you can ride farther. It's like having a superpower for your bike! If you want to explore more and have more fun, the Limba E-Bike is a great way to do it.",
